OL,3,GNEWSAWorld Fireworks Championship
OL,4,Aline-up unveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe line-up for the 2026 World
OL,7,FFireworks Championships has been
OL,8,Frevealed.
OL,10,FThousands of visitors are expected to
OL,11,Fwatch the dazzling displays in
OL,12,FBlackpool which take place over three
OL,13,Fnights - starting on Saturday.
OL,15,FAll competitors in this year's
OL,16,Fchampionships are former winners, with
OL,17,F2022 champions Wales opening this
OL,18,Fyear's event.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
