OL,3,GNEWSAWorld Fireworks Championship
OL,4,Aline-up unveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Africa will be putting on their
OL,7,Fpyrotechnic display on 26 September
OL,8,Fwith Germany putting on their show on
OL,9,F10 October.
